    "detailed_description": "Experience the challenges of being homeless, but now with a new job. Go out there and explore the world of EHP!<br><br>EHP is a single player money game where you have just got kicked out of the house and now you have to get yourself back on your feet with a starting \u00a32000 and a new job opportunity. Explore the world with vehicles and admire the colourful atmosphere. Stay on it for a long time to grind out as much money as possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul><br><strong>Rise up to the top</strong><br>The scoreboard which displays the top 10 most rich players in the game rise to the top and be the best. So go out there and explore the world of EHP.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300530/extras/Capture9.PNG?t=1677590408\" /></span><br><br><strong>Explore</strong><br>Drive round and explore the landscape of EHP.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300530/extras/Capture5.PNG?t=1677590408\" /></span><br><br><strong>Arcade</strong><br>Go to the arcade to play some fun minigames.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300530/extras/Capture7.PNG?t=1677590408\" /></span><br><br><strong>Car's</strong><br>Drive around with cars that can be purchased in the shop<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300530/extras/Capture8.PNG?t=1677590408\" /></span>",
